## 2026-08-19: Xiaomi trash/cache + ID social labels (additive, no OEM regress)

- Physical Xiaomi M2101K7AG (`9d2bb285`, session `cf23410e`): Gallery trash lives at
  `/sdcard/MIUI/Gallery/cloud/.trashBin/` (`{-trash-}*` files). Androjait recovered
  2 payloads there; SikSik QUICK only scanned Android/DCIM/Pictures/Movies/Download
  so `candidates_discovered=0`. MediaStore `is_trashed=1` is empty on this OEM.
- Emptied-trash previews on Infinix remain Gallery3D `imgcache*.idx` + `.thumbnails/{id}.jpg`
  skipped when the MediaStore id is still live. Xiaomi has no imgcache; leftover
  JPEGs are DiskLruCache under `.../gallery_disk_cache/{small_size,full_size}/*.0`
  (magic `FFD8FFE0`). Live `.thumbnails` ids 1729–1816 are still in MediaStore so
  they must not be recovered as deleted.
- Recovery: QUICK also scans `MIUI/` if that directory exists (no-op on Infinix/
  Samsung). Disk-cache JPEGs are pulled only when their SHA-256 is not a live
  MediaStore file. Existing imgcache/thumbnail/`.trashed-*` paths are unchanged.
- Social (ADB dump, not `input tap` — MIUI blocks INJECT_EVENTS): X drawer
  `Tampilkan laci navigasi` (keep exact `Show navigation drawer`; do not revive
  `descContains("Profile")` which clicked tweet avatars). X home `Untuk Anda` /
  `Mengikuti`. Facebook has no Profile tab (Beranda/Reels/Teman/Notifikasi/Grup);
  add `Menu` + `Buka profil` after the existing `Profil, tab` path. Instagram
  clicks `profile_header_menu` before desc/coordinate; sheet still must show
  Archive/Saved. Host reason `scope_runtime_error_${scope}` has no colon so
  `instrumentation_result_invalid` cannot drop Facebook. Overlay unchanged.

