## 2026-08-18: Host skipped social — urllib cannot read WDA /status

- Manual invoke IG/X/FB succeeded (profile + screenshots). Sesi akuisisi 23:15
  tetap `ios_afc_media+ios_backup_comms` tanpa record sosmed. `run_stack.sh`
  (curl) menulis "WDA HTTP ready"; host `_wda_ready` memakai `urllib.urlopen`
  / `http.client.read()` lalu `IncompleteRead` / `RemoteDisconnected` →
  fail-soft skip, flow tidak pernah dipanggil (tidak ada log `[IG]`).
- Probe host sekarang `curl -sf /status` seperti stack; fallback http.client
  mengabaikan IncompleteRead. Backend harus di-restart supaya terpakai.

## 2026-08-18: iOS social auto-setup per iPhone (DDI + UDID)

- Akar gagal sosmed: `ios image list` = `none`. Tanpa Developer Disk Image,
  `runwda` minta device port 0 → DTX broken pipe → WDA tidak pernah :8100.
  Mount hilang setiap reboot / ganti iPhone. `run_stack.sh` sekarang
  **wajib** auto-mount (pymobiledevice3, lalu `ios image auto`), restart
  tunnel, dan **gagal keras** kalau image masih kosong.
- Stack mengikuti **UDID sesi ini**: reset tunnel/WDA kalau HP berganti,
  tunnel hanya di-reuse jika `/tunnels` berisi UDID itu, cache bundle WDA
  per-UDID, USB `idevicepair` + Developer Mode + keep-awake dijalankan
  tiap akuisisi. Host tidak lagi skip `:8100` milik iPhone lama.
- iPhone baru: stack **tidak** `IOS_SKIP_WDA_INSTALL`; coba `ios install`
  IPA, AltServer hanya fallback. Flow JSON (`invoke.py`) tetap skip install
  karena WDA sudah hidup. Timeout boot 300s. Operator tetap ketuk Trust USB /
  Developer Mode / Trust profil WDA (Apple tidak mengizinkan otomasi itu).

