  DATE_ADDED / DATE_MODIFIED (or capture time) is inside the window; unknown dates
  stay. A photo taken years ago but added last month is kept.
- Galeri uses the same OR rule, anchored to **session created_at** so opening an
  old sesi later does not shrink the window.
