## 2026-08-17: Document grant wait, Instagram archive before comments, 3/6-month inventory

Bootstrap and documents:

- QUICK now waits for Semua file (`MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE`) the same way FULL
  already did: Settings opens on the device and the operator console enters
  `awaiting_access`. The progress message names the permission
